# Line endings, declared once for every checkout.
#
# This repository stores LF. Without an attribute saying so, a Windows checkout rewrites LF to CRLF
# (core.autocrlf is true on this machine and on the GitHub Windows runners), while Prettier is
# configured with "endOfLine": "lf". The first hosted CI run failed on all 216 files it checks for
# exactly that reason: the code was fine and the checkout differed from every machine that had ever
# tested it. Declaring the rule here means the repository, this machine and the runner agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets are never line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.asar binary
*.pak binary
*.bin binary
